## Go — Naming
```go
// Files: snake_case
product_repository.go

// Packages: single lowercase word
package sync

// Exported: PascalCase
type ProductRepository struct {}
func NewProductRepository(db *sqlx.DB) *ProductRepository {}

// Unexported: camelCase
type syncBatch struct {}
func (s *SyncService) processEvent(e SyncEvent) error {}

// Constants
const ShopTimezone = "Asia/Yangon"   // exported
const maxBatchSize = 50              // unexported
```

## Go — Shop Timezone
```go
// Always use timezone package — never time.Local or time.Now() raw
timezone.NowInShop()
timezone.IsSameShopDay(a, b)
timezone.ShopDateString(t)

// ❌ Wrong
time.Now()                              // device/server local
sale.CreatedAt.Day() != time.Now().Day() // wrong timezone comparison
```

## Testing Targets
| Code | Minimum coverage |
|------|-----------------|
| Sync event processor | 90% |
| Auth service | 90% |
| Inventory stock computation | 90% |
| Everything else | 70% |

Test files mirror source structure. Go tests in same directory as source. Flutter tests in `test/` mirroring `lib/`.

## Git / Commits
```
feat(pos): add barcode scan to cart
fix(sync): prevent event group split across batches
docs(api): resolve open questions
```
Format: `type(scope): lowercase description`, present tense, no period.
One logical change per commit. Commit before every new Cursor session.
